Z||000006||Oreif||04-12-2001||06:45 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by kslish:<BR><B> What do they charge for this conversion?<P>Ken S.<BR>'87 GT and '86 SC<BR> <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A> <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>For a used low mileage trans, installed, is around $3500.<P>||||reg||1
